Package: beutl
Maintainer: Yuto Terada <contact@beditor.net>
#Architecture: amd64 または arm64 ビルドスクリプトから設定
#Version: 1.0.0-1ubuntu22.04 ビルドスクリプトから設定
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.35), libgcc-s1, libstdc++6 (>= 11),
 libicu78 | libicu76 | libicu74 | libicu72 | libicu70, libssl3t64 | libssl3,
 fontconfig, libfontconfig1,
 libice6, libsm6, libx11-6, libxcursor1, libxext6, libxfixes3, libxi6, libxrandr2
Recommends: libgl1, libgtk-3-0t64 | libgtk-3-0, libpulse0 | libasound2t64 | libasound2, xdg-utils
Description: Cross-platform video editing (compositing) software.
 You can edit videos using keyframe functions and effects.
Homepage: https://github.com/b-editor/beutl
Vcs-Browser: https://github.com/b-editor/beutl
